["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/SupportType/support", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The artifact has been released, and is supported from the supplier. There is a validUntilDate that can provide additional information about the duration of support.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
